<div id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7" class="abe-column-block" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="121368391" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;">
  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Dear AJRP Participants,</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We hope you're doing well! We apologize for any inconvenience caused by our recent email system outage. If you reached out for assistance or had questions and didn’t receive a response, please note that we are still experiencing issues with our email accounts. You’re welcome to contact your YDS or assistant manager directly. Additionally, you can call or text Program Manager Maggie Davis at 614-400-6481 for assistance. Thank you for your understanding!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We are excited to inform you about our end-of-year ceremony!</p>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 18px;">End-of-Year Ceremony Details</h2>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong> Aug. 6, 10 a.m.- noon</strong><br><strong>Linden Community Center<br>1350 Briarwood Ave., 43211</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We will have a keynote speaker, acknowledge some of our participants for their outstanding performance this summer and bid farewell to our summer AJRP session. <strong><em>Note: Transportation will not be provided.</em></strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>ALL PARTICIPANTS MUST RSVP</strong> using the link below.</p>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #E41B2B; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#E41B2B"><a href="https://form.jotform.com/242114889936165?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">REGISTER</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; color: #00539B; margin: 0.83em 0 18px;">AJRP End-of-Summer Fun Day</h2>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Additionally, our AJRP End-of-Summer Fun Day will be held on Aug. 7. All AJRP participants who attend the end-of-year ceremony are eligible to join us for the Fun Day, provided they did not receive any major disciplinary actions during our summer session. Plans are being finalized for Fun Day and details will follow. If you have questions regarding your opportunity to be involved in Fun Day, please reach out directly to your assistant manager.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Again, at the moment, the best way to contact us is to reach out to your YDS or assistant manager directly. Additionally, you can call or text Program Manager Maggie Davis at 614-400-6481 for assistance. </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Best,</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">AJRP Team</p>
</td>
